   "sourceHash": "be50ade1f2cc0a75edff71f6a4ffe4e1f60e0a118babbd89e1566c802318e358",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]可在家中延续的阿育吠陀饮食与作息指导。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
