   "sourceHash": "4a764af2a5f156dd697236d49488f19cfee55bce8378fc94e328eb2a26b2ca66",
   "text": "预防与再生方案 – Swasthya Rakshana Chikitsa（奇基察）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3721989fe05791c10c3f",
   "sourceHash": "3721989fe05791c10c3f66f8ea621b3595543b9b3d73c35facf7158be2958bd3",
   "text": "我们会根据阿育吠陀原则为您制定定制饮食计划。参与者还将学习有益日常健康的生活习惯。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_92164e51fc450779e9f0",
   "sourceHash": "92164e51fc450779e9f01b1a3effc8d58ca72be171212b7d430c409906b8712b",
   "text": "再生身体排毒方案注重放松和缓解日常压力。所用技术包括院内自制草药油疗法（Abhyangam，阿比扬伽）和瑜伽练习。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
